        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Snowboard Academy, Red Sonja, Rocky IV\n- People: Brigitte Nielsen, Corey Haim, Jim Varney, Rudy Rupak, Greg Gorman, Helmut Newton\n- Topics: film production, acting, modelling\n\nFacts:\n- Brigitte Nielsen was born as Gitte Nielsen on 15 July 1963 and is a Danish-Italian actress, model, singer, and reality television personality.\n- Brigitte Nielsen began her career modelling for Greg Gorman and Helmut Newton.\n- Brigitte Nielsen later acted in the 1985 films Red Sonja and Rocky IV.\n- Snowboard Academy is a 1997 independent slapstick comedy film.\n- Snowboard Academy stars Corey Haim, Jim Varney, and Brigitte Nielsen.\n- Rudy Rupak is known for producing Snowboard Academy.",
